## Verification Checklist

After creating an entity:
- [ ] Permission checks in all resolvers
- [ ] Database sessions closed
- [ ] Audit fields populated from `user.id`
- [ ] Soft-deleted records filtered
- [ ] Permissions seeded
- [ ] Migration generated and applied
- [ ] **Documentation updated** in `prompts/01-entity-reference.md`

---

Remember: Security (RBAC) and documentation are NOT optional!
